1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,220
Man: Did you go to the rock concert in the park yesterday afternoon?

2
00:00:07,220 --> 00:00:10,877
Woman: I went to a gardening workshop at the University Center instead.

3
00:00:10,877 --> 00:00:13,620
It's sad that I missed out on the concert,

4
00:00:13,620 --> 00:00:17,760
but I'm starting my own garden and I need to know all the ins

5
00:00:17,760 --> 00:00:20,020
and outs of growing herbs and vegetables.

6
00:00:20,020 --> 00:00:23,250
Man: Nice. And to be honest, you didn't miss that much.

7
00:00:23,250 --> 00:00:24,210
Woman: No?

8
00:00:24,210 --> 00:00:27,500
Man: Well, I love some of the songs they played

9
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:30,998
but the acoustics in the park aren't very good,

10
00:00:30,998 --> 00:00:36,000
so the sound quality was rather mediocre and didn't do justice to the songs.
